  "hindi": "हे इन्द्र, हमारे शत्रुओं को चूर-चूर कर दो; युद्ध करने वालों को नीचे दबा दो। जो हम पर आक्रमण करता है, उसे सबसे नीचे के अन्धकार में पहुँचा दो।",
  "english": "Indra, strike apart our foes; press down those who make war on us. Whoever assails us, send him to the lowest darkness.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "naḥ is read as the enclitic pronoun 'our' (naḥ + indra giving na indra); vi ... jahi taken as 'smite apart'. mṛdh (f.) is 'foe/enemy' (also 'contempt').",
  "confidence": "medium",
  "type": "verse",
  "line_ids": [
   "001.021.2a",
   "001.021.2b"
  ],
  "lines_deva": [
   "वि न॑ इन्द्र॒ मृधो॑ जहि नीचा॒ य॑च्छ पृतन्य॒तः",
   "अ॒ध॒मं ग॑मया॒ तमो॒ यो अ॒स्माँ अ॑भि॒दास॑ति"
  ],
  "lines_iast": [
